<lb n="11"/>wenig, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sonderlich</unclear> aber nicht wisse, daß man <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Ime</unclear> allhie
<lb n="12"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">mehr</unclear> dann <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">9</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fl</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schuldig</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seie</unclear>, So werden <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wür</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verursacht</unclear>
<lb n="13"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uber</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sein</unclear> verlassenschafft <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> zu <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Jedermeniklichs</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rechten</unclear>
<lb n="14"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">offene</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Edicta</unclear> (<unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">massen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Si</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hiebei</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">auch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eines</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">der</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Irig</unclear>
